# Tweet Disaster Classification Model

## 🎯 Project Overview

This notebook implements a machine learning model to classify tweets as disaster-related or not. The model uses NLP techniques with TF-IDF vectorization and various classifiers.

**Dataset**: Twitter disaster tweets dataset with binary labels (1=disaster, 0=non-disaster)

